			"notes": "## Stash-Hunter 0.2.0\n\nMeteor Client addon for finding stashes on anarchy servers.\n\n### Highlights\n- Updated to **Minecraft 1.21.11**\n- **Telegram bot notifications** — stash found, player detected, death/respawn, disconnect, out-of-elytra, stuck, scan completion, and a startup message are all sent to your Telegram bot (works alongside or instead of Discord). See the README for setup.\n- Auto-flight now properly drives Meteor **ElytraFly** and holds altitude (auto-takeoff, no more constant descent).\n\n### Install\n1. Install Fabric for 1.21.11 + Meteor Client.\n2. Drop `stash-hunter-0.2.0.jar` into your `mods` folder.\n3. Enable the **Stash-Hunter** module and configure Telegram in its settings."
		},
